{"ts":1793397352976,"event":"done","summary":"PLAT-103 shipped. (1) contracts: validateApp now throws when app.owner is missing/empty; breaking change released as @mfe/shared-contracts 2.0.0 (PR #1, CD published 2.0.0). (2) billing: passes owner 'payments' (package.json team), depends on ^2.0.0 (PR #2, live). (3) core shell: passes owner 'platform', depends on ^2.0.0 (PR #3, live). (4) Added beyond the sub-tasks: sub-route-reports also called validateApp without an owner and would break on upgrade; it now passes owner 'insights' and depends on ^2.0.0 (PR #4, live). st audit: 0 violations. Assumptions: owner values were hardcoded to the team value from each package.json rather than read from package.json at build time; reports was in scope because the audit acceptance criterion covers all apps; no app version bumps were made since CONTRIBUTING only requires them for libraries."}
